1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 39=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,920
Didn't you want to know

7
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,680
how our ways

8
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:47,560
differ?

9
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:23,479
♪These shackles weigh like a mountain♪

10
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:29,960
♪They break my very spine♪

11
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:30,800
This is

12
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:32,000
the great Tang general

13
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,319
Gao Xianzhi?

14
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,080
That's right.

15
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:40,639
General Gao was much like you,
Young Master.

16
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,159
He, too, came from a noble family,

17
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:44,919
was well-read from childhood,

18
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,560
and was a fearless warrior.

19
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:49,319
He was made a general in his twenties.

20
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:51,439
The eunuch Bian Lingcheng

21
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:54,240
was sent by Emperor Xuanzong
to oversee the army.

22
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,719
A coward who'd forsake honor for profit.

23
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:01,000
Gao Xianzhi defied Bian Lingcheng's
repeated attempts to stop him

24
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,639
and led his men across the glaciers
at the risk of his life,

25
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,719
conquering Lesser Bolv in one strike

26
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,439
and capturing its king alive.

27
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,280
After that battle,

28
00:03:10,648 --> 00:03:12,190
the Tang's renown grew even greater.

29
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:14,759
From Anyuan Gate west to the border,

30
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,599
stretching 6,000 km,

31
00:03:16,808 --> 00:03:19,830
villages lay in sight of one another,
and mulberry and hemp covered the land.

32
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,479
Of all the rich lands under heaven,

33
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:22,800
none could match Longyou.

34
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,280
♪His Majesty declares♪

35
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:27,919
♪Merit that eclipses the throne
is a crime in itself♪

36
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,919
♪The general's star shines too bright♪

37
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:32,400
Though Gao Xianzhi won the battle

38
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,719
and was made a duke,

39
00:03:34,879 --> 00:03:36,080
he incurred Bian Lingcheng's

40
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,520
bitter resentment.

41
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:40,400
♪Let me cleanse♪

42
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:43,199
♪Your disloyal soul♪

43
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:53,240
♪His loyalty served a den of jackals♪

44
00:03:53,319 --> 00:04:02,439
♪His blood spilled in vain
at a feast of flatterers♪

45
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,039
♪Execute him♪

46
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:45,240
♪Let me send the general off myself♪

47
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:27,879
♪If Taizong asks me in the underworld♪

48
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:32,680
♪Let the cuckoo carry my wronged soul♪

49
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:36,279
♪See Xingqing Palace's peonies wither♪

50
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:41,319
♪While Huaqing Pool gleams with rouge♪

51
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:49,319
♪Behold, the moon above
the armored general's grave♪

52
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:50,959
♪Shining down upon♪

53
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:55,800
♪The swirling Rainbow Feather Dance♪

54
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,480
His Majesty

55
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:20,360
is a wise ruler.

56
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,560
And I am utterly loyal.

57
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:32,600
In the golden age of Kaiyuan,

58
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,040
Gao Xianzhi also firmly believed

59
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,439
Emperor Xuanzong was a wise ruler.

60
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:42,839
The wind is born from the earth

61
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:45,319
and stirs at the tips of the duckweed.

62
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:49,519
Even I, an outsider to the court,
can see it.

63
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,360
Yet you turn a blind eye, Young Master.

64
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,120
You just don't want to see it.

65
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:13,240
This is my way.

66
00:07:18,984 --> 00:07:21,290
I don't accept that subjects
must submit to their rulers,

67
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:24,240
sons to fathers, and wives to husbands.

68
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,959
Why must a subject die
just because his ruler says so?

69
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,079
They say murder must be paid in blood.

70
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,199
Yet in this world,

71
00:07:33,759 --> 00:07:34,959
the one who kills the most,

72
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,879
by the cruelest means,

73
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,399
is the Son of Heaven.

74
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,399
Wiping out entire families,

75
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,399
executing ten degrees of kin,

76
00:07:46,488 --> 00:07:48,390
cutting men in half,
and slicing them apart...

77
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,439
Aren't these all the Emperor's doing?

78
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,360
I know

79
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,399
you've also defied convention at times.

80
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:12,199
You dared to cane your father
for your mother's sake.

81
00:08:12,504 --> 00:08:14,750
You dared to secretly bury
Grand Secretary Shen's family.

82
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:16,639
You even dared to secretly free...

83
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:20,879
But

84
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:23,160
in the end, you

85
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:26,160
are still the Lin family's Young Master.

86
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,399
You must devote yourself to the throne

87
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:33,080
to glorify your forebears and heirs,

88
00:08:33,816 --> 00:08:35,390
and win honors for your wife and sons.

89
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:46,879
I know

90
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,440
what I've said today

91
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,960
is shocking.

92
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:53,440
If you can't accept it,

93
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,200
you can pretend it never happened.

94
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:13,000
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

95
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:16,480
Up at dawn to study hard,

96
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,679
pricking the thigh to stay awake,

97
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:20,480
hair tied to a beam to stay up,

98
00:09:20,616 --> 00:09:22,440
reading by a neighbor's borrowed light.

99
00:09:22,559 --> 00:09:25,720
One day, first in the imperial exam,

100
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:29,320
a high official seated in court.

101
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:33,639
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

102
00:09:33,799 --> 00:09:37,120
Up at dawn to train hard,

103
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,840
sword in hand at first light,

104
00:09:39,279 --> 00:09:40,840
through winter cold and summer heat,

105
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,559
never once going home.

106
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:46,440
Then off to glory on a white horse,

107
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:50,120
bringing home gold and jade.

108
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,460
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

109
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:57,820
(Three Months Later)

110
00:09:58,180 --> 00:10:00,759
(Lin Zhangrui,
son of Lin Jinlan and Tan Suhua)

111
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:01,559
Who's this?

112
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:02,879
Call me big sister.

113
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:04,759
I will give you candy, okay?

114
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:07,039
Call me Auntie.

115
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,639
Auntie will buy you toys.

116
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,360
Call me big sister.

117
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,960
Our little one is so sturdy.

118
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,120
You'll grow up just like Uncle Jinqi,

119
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,039
strong and healthy,

120
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:20,200
and become a great general.

121
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:21,200
Right?

122
00:10:25,679 --> 00:10:27,639
This child is so hardy.

123
00:10:27,639 --> 00:10:29,559
Eats well and sleeps well all day.

124
00:10:29,559 --> 00:10:30,320
Don't you?

125
00:10:33,448 --> 00:10:34,270
Have you and Jinlan

126
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:36,240
decided on his hundred-day celebration?

127
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:38,840
Jinlan says with the elders away,

128
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,260
there's no need for a grand affair.

129
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,960
Just a family gathering will do.

130
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,879
In his letter, the Old Master

131
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,799
asked about the child.

132
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:52,960
With the child this big,

133
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,039
I can't hide it any longer.

134
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,600
I had to tell him the truth.

135
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,320
I'd guess that once spring comes,

136
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:01,159
Concubine Zhou will rush to the capital.

137
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:03,960
The Master may even come, too.

138
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,639
I've already stolen from Heaven

139
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:07,039
two whole years of freedom.

140
00:11:07,919 --> 00:11:08,799
I'm content.

141
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,039
I'm only sorry that for my sake, Jinqi,

142
00:11:12,296 --> 00:11:13,840
you'll be scolded by the Master again.

143
00:11:14,919 --> 00:11:16,720
The Master has never liked me anyway.

144
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:18,639
In one ear and out the other.

145
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,879
I'll just ignore him.

146
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:31,240
This winter,

147
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:32,790
you seem unusually sensitive to cold.

148
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,120
Tell me the truth.

149
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,000
How is your health, really?

150
00:11:40,639 --> 00:11:41,399
I'm fine.

151
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:48,840
Jinlan.

152
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:50,200
Jinlan!

153
00:11:52,159 --> 00:11:52,720
Jinlan!

154
00:11:55,384 --> 00:11:56,904
Jinlan's heart condition is acting up!

155
00:11:56,936 --> 00:11:57,840
Get a physician, quick!

156
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:05,960
Jinlan.

157
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:09,519
Medicine...

158
00:12:19,128 --> 00:12:20,080
Jinlan.

159
00:12:25,672 --> 00:12:26,510
Jinlan.

160
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,559
Jinlan can't breathe.

161
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:29,759
Everyone, stay back.

162
00:12:30,519 --> 00:12:31,480
Open the window a crack.

163
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,120
Come back.

164
00:12:44,824 --> 00:12:45,630
Second Young Master.

165
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:53,759
I'm here.

166
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,080
Jinlan...

167
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,399
I'm sorry.

168
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:15,960
Jinlan,

169
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:17,799
don't talk, okay?

170
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,639
Hold on a little longer.

171
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:23,200
The physician will be here soon.

172
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,480
No tears.

173
00:13:53,112 --> 00:13:54,080
I won't cry anymore.

174
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,360
I promised you

175
00:14:01,039 --> 00:14:01,840
I'd be strong

176
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,080
and not cry.

177
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,320
Here's the baby.

178
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:30,799
Jinlan.

179
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,480
For Suhua and the baby,

180
00:14:33,559 --> 00:14:34,840
hold on a little longer.

181
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,080
The physician is on his way.

182
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,240
All right.

183
00:14:47,559 --> 00:14:48,399
I promise you.

184
00:14:49,759 --> 00:14:51,000
I'll take good care of the child

185
00:14:52,679 --> 00:14:53,840
and raise him well.

186
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,600
Jinlan says

187
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,519
he'll be your brother again
in the next life,

188
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,600
and repay your kindness.

189
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,120
Here's the baby.

190
00:15:57,039 --> 00:15:58,039
Don't worry.

191
00:15:59,279 --> 00:16:01,320
Suhua is like my own sister.

192
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:04,840
As long as I'm in the Lin Residence,

193
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,720
I'll never let her be wronged.

194
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:22,620
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

195
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:25,980
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

196
00:16:26,980 --> 00:16:30,700
♪Are kept within this little world♪

197
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:37,660
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

198
00:16:40,559 --> 00:16:41,039
Suhua.

199
00:16:42,472 --> 00:16:43,200
Enjoy your meal.

200
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:51,060
♪With my own hands and heart♪

201
00:16:51,060 --> 00:16:54,260
♪I write my name♪

202
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:58,300
♪Through countless lines of ink♪

203
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:01,540
♪Step by step toward the light♪

204
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,200
Jinlan...

205
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:06,960
Jinlan...

206
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,380
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

207
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:11,660
♪The long night is almost over♪

208
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:20,100
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

209
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:37,660
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

210
00:17:38,340 --> 00:17:41,220
♪The encounters of half a lifetime♪

211
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:45,980
♪Are kept within this little world♪

212
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:52,660
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

213
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,079
Jinlan.

214
00:17:57,550 --> 00:17:59,992
Guan Zhong did not die. Du Huo.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "to live alone."]

215
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:01,160
Good.

216
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,319
Well done, Jinlan!

217
00:18:04,264 --> 00:18:05,890
Thank you, Grandfather, for allowing it.

218
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,079
Don't panic.

219
00:18:08,312 --> 00:18:10,440
The more urgent things get,
the calmer you must stay.

220
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:14,319
Thank you and Lanxiang,
for taking care of everything.

221
00:18:14,319 --> 00:18:16,940
♪Step by step toward the light♪

222
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:21,060
♪With what I know and what I do♪

223
00:18:21,060 --> 00:18:24,340
♪I'll rewrite my fate♪

224
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:26,380
♪The long night is almost over♪

225
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:34,820
♪I won't dwell on the past anymore♪

226
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:12,400
Suhua, take a look.

227
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:14,359
Is this all right?

228
00:19:20,839 --> 00:19:21,759
It's very well done.

229
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:33,220
(Lin Zhangrui, Nine Months Old)

230
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,119
Second Young Lady!

231
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,200
Second Young Lady!

232
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:39,200
Second Young Madam!

233
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:40,920
Go to the front, quickly!

234
00:19:41,096 --> 00:19:43,340
A messenger has come from Jinling
with news of a death.

235
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:44,519
Old Madam

236
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,200
has passed away.

237
00:19:55,039 --> 00:19:56,279
In the last letter,

238
00:19:57,480 --> 00:20:00,240
Mother said Grandmother was much better

239
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,400
and her speech had become clearer.

240
00:20:04,559 --> 00:20:06,359
How could she suddenly be gone?

241
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:12,000
I've been so unfilial.

242
00:20:13,039 --> 00:20:15,200
I'd already separated and returned home,

243
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:19,200
yet I didn't go back to Jinling
to care for Grandmother.

244
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,119
Old Madam lived a long life.

245
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:26,319
Xiulai, Xiuwan,

246
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:28,240
don't blame yourselves too much.

247
00:20:32,519 --> 00:20:34,000
Why won't the Old Master

248
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,240
let us go home for the funeral?

249
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:39,000
To save on military expenses,

250
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,488
His Majesty is slashing troop numbers.

251
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:43,160
Too many men, and too few posts.

252
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:45,000
Many hold official titles

253
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:47,000
but have no real duties.

254
00:20:51,359 --> 00:20:53,519
If Jinqi returns to Jinling to mourn,

255
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,400
the round trip

256
00:20:55,816 --> 00:20:57,440
would take two or three months at least.

257
00:20:58,904 --> 00:21:00,440
The Old Master fears that Jinqi's post

258
00:21:00,440 --> 00:21:01,770
would be filled by someone else.

259
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:03,000
The Old Master

260
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,799
is just taking precautions.

261
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:08,920
But I miss Mother

262
00:21:09,319 --> 00:21:11,039
and my brothers.

263
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:13,960
I want to go back to Jinling.

264
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,559
When the Second Young Master died,

265
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:19,880
it was bitterly cold.

266
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:22,039
With a frail mother and a baby,

267
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:23,559
we couldn't take his coffin home.

268
00:21:24,799 --> 00:21:26,720
If Xiuwan wants to go back to Jinling,

269
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:28,880
Zhangrui and I

270
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,880
will take his coffin back with us

271
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,160
and lay him to rest.

272
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,079
This is no small matter.

273
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,799
We should let the Young Master decide.

274
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,559
From the capital to Jinling

275
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,079
is a long way.

276
00:21:52,640 --> 00:21:55,359
Zhangrui is young and frail,

277
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:58,079
at an age when he falls ill easily.

278
00:21:59,839 --> 00:22:00,920
On the way,

279
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:03,400
if he doesn't adapt to new surroundings

280
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:04,759
or comes down with a fever,

281
00:22:06,039 --> 00:22:07,720
I couldn't face Jinlan.

282
00:22:13,279 --> 00:22:14,000
How about

283
00:22:14,799 --> 00:22:16,920
I take Suhua and Xiuwan

284
00:22:17,079 --> 00:22:18,039
back myself?

285
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,319
After Jinlan passed,

286
00:22:24,839 --> 00:22:27,279
you requested leave
to bring him back to Jinling.

287
00:22:28,039 --> 00:22:29,599
His Majesty offered kind words

288
00:22:29,799 --> 00:22:31,640
but refused to grant the leave.

289
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:34,079
Now Suhua and Xiuwan

290
00:22:34,319 --> 00:22:35,559
are desperately homesick.

291
00:22:36,359 --> 00:22:37,559
I could go on your behalf

292
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:39,119
and take them back with me.

293
00:22:58,039 --> 00:22:59,119
As for returning to Jinling,

294
00:23:00,559 --> 00:23:01,720
let me think it over.

295
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,480
Young Master, do you miss
your family in Jinling?

296
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:21,440
In less than half a year,

297
00:23:23,319 --> 00:23:25,319
I've lost two of my closest kin.

298
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:29,400
How could I not miss

299
00:23:30,119 --> 00:23:31,640
everyone back home?

300
00:23:37,039 --> 00:23:38,559
Last year at the theater,

301
00:23:40,359 --> 00:23:42,160
you named so much you don't believe in.

302
00:23:43,599 --> 00:23:45,079
But in this life,

303
00:23:47,079 --> 00:23:48,440
disbelief alone isn't enough.

304
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,519
You have to believe in something

305
00:23:53,519 --> 00:23:55,000
to keep going, don't you?

306
00:24:00,599 --> 00:24:01,519
I believe

307
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:03,640
the Way of Heaven favors no one.

308
00:24:08,079 --> 00:24:09,240
Isn't that so?

309
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,000
Of all beings in this world,

310
00:24:13,240 --> 00:24:15,440
why are some born rich

311
00:24:15,759 --> 00:24:17,359
and others born poor?

312
00:24:18,799 --> 00:24:21,240
Why do some live long, healthy lives

313
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:23,640
while others die young and sickly?

314
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:28,039
Why was Lin Jinqi born

315
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:30,160
a lofty master,

316
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:33,440
while Xu Lanxiang was born

317
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,640
a lowly servant?

318
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:43,160
You have a point.

319
00:24:45,279 --> 00:24:46,480
I'm just surprised

320
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:49,960
you don't even believe
in the Way of Heaven.

321
00:24:51,599 --> 00:24:52,279
No.

322
00:24:53,304 --> 00:24:54,750
I do believe in the Way of Heaven.

323
00:24:59,079 --> 00:25:00,279
Thank you, Madam.

324
00:25:01,039 --> 00:25:04,519
You and the young lady are good people.
You'll surely be rewarded.

325
00:25:05,279 --> 00:25:06,480
Thank you, Madam.

326
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:10,920
Give them my spare clothes.

327
00:25:15,279 --> 00:25:17,160
Oh, Heaven!

328
00:25:20,119 --> 00:25:21,039
I believe

329
00:25:22,799 --> 00:25:24,160
the Way of Heaven favors no one,

330
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:26,440
but always sides with the good.

331
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:35,680
The Way of Heaven favors no one,

332
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:38,400
but always sides with the good.

333
00:25:43,599 --> 00:25:45,359
Though this "good" is not that "good,"

334
00:25:46,039 --> 00:25:47,200
compassion

335
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,240
is itself wisdom.

336
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:51,799
Like the palm and back of a hand,

337
00:25:52,456 --> 00:25:53,680
they're two sides of one whole.

338
00:26:06,424 --> 00:26:08,520
(Evidence of Lin Jinqi's Crimes)
Heaven and Earth are not benevolent.

339
00:26:08,880 --> 00:26:10,759
They treat all things as straw dogs.

340
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:13,640
The Emperor is not benevolent.

341
00:26:14,799 --> 00:26:16,559
He treats the people as straw dogs.

342
00:26:26,279 --> 00:26:27,640
However clever one may be,

343
00:26:29,559 --> 00:26:31,440
no one can see the future.

344
00:26:39,540 --> 00:26:43,500
(Two Years Later)

345
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:50,559
Quick, don't let it get away!

346
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:51,839
Over there!

347
00:27:11,519 --> 00:27:13,079
This is the Eldest Prince's treasure.

348
00:27:13,559 --> 00:27:14,759
Good thing it didn't get away.

349
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:15,400
Let's go.

350
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:28,799
This should be Scholar Chen's class now.

351
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:29,832
(Hai Tao, Fourth-Rank Eunuch)
Those two

352
00:27:29,832 --> 00:27:30,500
(of the Directorate of Ceremonial)
little brats

353
00:27:30,519 --> 00:27:31,960
(Wang Cheng, Fourth-Rank Eunuch)
are skipping class at the Inner School

354
00:27:32,279 --> 00:27:33,240
(of the Directorate of Ceremonial)
to fool around here.

355
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,720
What a disgrace!

356
00:27:36,799 --> 00:27:38,240
Those two young eunuchs

357
00:27:38,519 --> 00:27:40,079
have already become the godsons

358
00:27:40,079 --> 00:27:42,200
of the Prince's head attendant, Wang Yi.

359
00:27:42,799 --> 00:27:45,440
Wang Yi will surely keep them in line.

360
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,440
Why meddle?

361
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:49,599
The Eldest Prince

362
00:27:49,839 --> 00:27:51,519
favors Wang Yi far too much.

363
00:27:53,079 --> 00:27:54,319
Some officials also say

364
00:27:54,559 --> 00:27:56,079
His Majesty favors us too much,

365
00:27:56,279 --> 00:27:58,559
letting even memorials pass through us.

366
00:27:58,759 --> 00:28:00,200
We are utterly loyal.

367
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,279
How could a flatterer

368
00:28:01,279 --> 00:28:02,960
like Wang Yi compare to us?

369
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:07,559
Enough. Let's go.

370
00:28:08,039 --> 00:28:11,200
His Majesty is waiting to see
the General Qinglong.

371
00:28:14,420 --> 00:28:31,140
(Eunuchs shall not meddle in politics.)

372
00:28:44,860 --> 00:28:48,839
(Eunuchs shall not meddle in politics.)

373
00:28:48,839 --> 00:28:52,079
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

374
00:28:52,519 --> 00:28:55,519
Ants in the roots bring down the beams.

375
00:28:56,319 --> 00:29:01,519
In silk and jade, they upend all order,

376
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:04,880
killing the old, killing the young.

377
00:29:05,319 --> 00:29:08,519
A tiger at the door, a wolf out back.

378
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:19,359
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

379
00:29:19,599 --> 00:29:22,799
Palace walls
are built on piles of bones.

380
00:29:23,759 --> 00:29:29,319
Rise or fall, right or wrong, all folly.

381
00:29:29,759 --> 00:29:33,119
Hailed as a hero of the realm yesterday,

382
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:37,000
dumped in a mass grave today.

383
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:59,319
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

384
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:03,240
Grass grows where grand palaces burned.

385
00:30:03,519 --> 00:30:09,319
Loyal or traitor, all a passing dream.

386
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:13,079
Wise ministers and famous generals,

387
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:17,119
nothing left but a crumbling wall.

388
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:31,559
Tofu! Fresh tofu!

389
00:30:31,559 --> 00:30:32,740
(Taiping)

390
00:30:33,400 --> 00:30:34,400
Tofu!

391
00:30:34,960 --> 00:30:36,440
Fresh tofu!

392
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,319
Tofu!

393
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,799
Fresh tofu!

394
00:30:46,480 --> 00:30:47,759
Two buns, please.

395
00:30:47,759 --> 00:30:48,759
Coming right up.

396
00:31:31,500 --> 00:31:38,460
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

397
00:31:57,180 --> 00:31:59,780
♪Look at us♪

398
00:32:00,660 --> 00:32:04,660
♪We've shared countless
beautiful moments♪

399
00:32:05,920 --> 00:32:09,839
Sunlight bright, and moonlight bright.

400
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:13,480
Red candles flicker,
and blossoms are sweet.

401
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:19,799
Hand in hand, we laugh as one,
a pair of mandarin ducks.

402
00:32:20,519 --> 00:32:23,960
Unafraid of the world's wind and frost.

403
00:32:24,359 --> 00:32:27,960
Face to face,
dawn to dusk, love endures.

404
00:32:27,960 --> 00:32:30,580
♪Our bond runs deep♪

405
00:32:30,980 --> 00:32:34,340
♪Binding us closely together♪

406
00:32:34,740 --> 00:32:38,060
♪Washing away the dust
of this mortal world♪

407
00:32:38,060 --> 00:32:42,300
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

408
00:32:43,020 --> 00:32:46,580
♪I'll have no regrets
that we met in this life♪

409
00:32:46,580 --> 00:32:50,500
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

410
00:32:50,900 --> 00:32:54,340
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

411
00:32:54,340 --> 00:32:58,060
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

412
00:32:58,060 --> 00:33:00,900
♪Our bond runs deep♪

413
00:33:01,700 --> 00:33:04,860
♪Binding us closely together♪

414
00:33:05,300 --> 00:33:08,260
♪Washing away the dust
of this mortal world♪

415
00:33:08,260 --> 00:33:12,380
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

416
00:33:13,140 --> 00:33:17,180
♪I'll have no regrets
that we met in this life♪

417
00:33:17,180 --> 00:33:20,980
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

418
00:33:21,460 --> 00:33:24,660
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

419
00:33:24,660 --> 00:33:28,540
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

420
00:33:28,540 --> 00:33:31,540
♪Our bond runs deep♪

421
00:33:31,940 --> 00:33:35,420
♪Binding us closely together♪

422
00:33:35,700 --> 00:33:38,740
♪After all the questions
life has brought♪

423
00:33:38,740 --> 00:33:42,820
♪This love has never faded
in the slightest♪

424
00:33:43,860 --> 00:33:47,580
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

425
00:33:47,980 --> 00:33:51,460
♪How fortunate to find
one person in a lifetime♪

426
00:33:51,820 --> 00:33:53,860
♪Through these warm and gentle years♪

427
00:33:53,860 --> 00:33:59,940
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

428
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:22,480
Come and see!

429
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:26,079
(Taiping)
Lotus in June, lotus root in August!

430
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:29,679
Fresh and tender, the tastiest!

431
00:34:31,039 --> 00:34:33,920
Come and see!

432
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:37,280
Lotus in June, lotus root in August!

433
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:40,039
Fresh and tender, the tastiest!

434
00:34:40,039 --> 00:34:41,360
What fresh lotus root!

435
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:42,119
Give me some.

436
00:35:26,239 --> 00:35:27,360
You're pregnant now.

437
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,880
Mister Lu is sleeping.

438
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,280
You're expecting now.

439
00:35:32,679 --> 00:35:33,360
Be careful.

440
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:37,239
I'm healthy. I'm not that delicate.

441
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:46,000
You're here.

442
00:35:46,719 --> 00:35:47,320
Mother.

443
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:50,719
This lotus root

444
00:35:51,039 --> 00:35:52,480
looks so fresh.

445
00:35:57,440 --> 00:35:58,800
Come, have a seat.

446
00:35:59,000 --> 00:35:59,480
All right.

447
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:08,639
Mother, you've mixed them up.

448
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:13,119
The blue tiger-head shoes and bellyband

449
00:36:13,599 --> 00:36:15,079
are for Zhangrui.

450
00:36:16,039 --> 00:36:18,360
The red ones are for An.

451
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:20,280
That's right now.

452
00:36:20,559 --> 00:36:21,400
Right.

453
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,360
Whose child is An?

454
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:27,760
Sister Han's, from next door.

455
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:29,320
He's the same age as Zhangrui.

456
00:36:29,400 --> 00:36:30,639
Both were born in August,

457
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:32,639
so Mother got gifts for them both.

458
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:36,119
After Third Place Scholar Han
became the top provincial graduate,

459
00:36:36,119 --> 00:36:37,760
many came with marriage proposals.

460
00:36:38,119 --> 00:36:39,239
So he decided

461
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,159
to marry his sister

462
00:36:40,159 --> 00:36:42,840
to a classmate from Qixia Academy.

463
00:36:43,159 --> 00:36:43,960
Now,

464
00:36:44,239 --> 00:36:44,840
he's...

465
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:47,559
he's teaching students to count.

466
00:36:49,199 --> 00:36:50,000
Arithmetic.

467
00:36:51,039 --> 00:36:52,760
The study of doing accounts.

468
00:36:53,239 --> 00:36:53,800
Yes.

469
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,800
They'll surely be good at bookkeeping.

470
00:37:04,320 --> 00:37:04,880
Let me.

471
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:08,039
Look at you.

472
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:09,320
Getting old,

473
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:11,760
a little work and my back aches.

474
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:13,880
Tomorrow

475
00:37:13,880 --> 00:37:15,679
I'll hire a boy to help at the shop.

476
00:37:16,840 --> 00:37:17,559
No need.

477
00:37:17,719 --> 00:37:19,360
Your father's just acting spoiled

478
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:20,559
because you're here.

479
00:37:21,119 --> 00:37:22,079
Me? Acting spoiled?

480
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:29,239
Well, when you just told Lanxiang

481
00:37:29,599 --> 00:37:31,039
that when you do needlework,

482
00:37:31,039 --> 00:37:32,380
your eyes blur and you can't see,

483
00:37:32,440 --> 00:37:33,768
weren't you acting spoiled too?

484
00:37:34,159 --> 00:37:35,800
I'm acting spoiled with my daughter.

485
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:37,559
My daughter cares about me.

486
00:37:37,639 --> 00:37:38,440
So what?

487
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,079
Fine.

488
00:37:42,080 --> 00:37:43,448
You're getting younger by the day.

489
00:37:46,856 --> 00:37:48,630
(Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees)

490
00:37:48,639 --> 00:37:50,239
Isn't there a set in my study?

491
00:37:50,920 --> 00:37:53,000
Xiushu's dowry gift
is in a few days.

492
00:37:53,199 --> 00:37:54,639
This is my gift for her dowry.

493
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,639
That's quite a gift.

494
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,519
Even if Xiushu has no use for it,

495
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:01,920
her children can read it.

496
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:06,199
Are you mocking me, Young Master Lin?

497
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:07,880
No.

498
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:09,519
A gift from you

499
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:11,679
is surely your most treasured one.

500
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:18,280
Good. Very good.

501
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:19,199
A fine gift.

502
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:27,159
Look.

503
00:38:27,159 --> 00:38:28,559
How lovely!

504
00:38:29,880 --> 00:38:32,679
(Lin Xiushu, 19)
I knew Madam Guan painted fine Buddhas,

505
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:35,000
but thanks to Xiushu,

506
00:38:35,039 --> 00:38:36,840
I finally get to see one.

507
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,320
Thank you, Aunt.

508
00:38:41,239 --> 00:38:43,239
You're welcome. It's only right.

509
00:38:43,840 --> 00:38:45,480
Please, have a seat.

510
00:38:46,840 --> 00:38:48,920
Lovely. Truly lovely.

511
00:38:54,079 --> 00:38:55,639
We elders

512
00:38:55,679 --> 00:38:57,840
bring out our very best.

513
00:38:58,039 --> 00:39:00,119
As for you well-off families,

514
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:01,719
if what you bring today

515
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:03,440
isn't your finest treasure,

516
00:39:03,519 --> 00:39:05,519
I'll be the first to object.

517
00:39:24,460 --> 00:39:28,540
(Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees)

518
00:39:29,816 --> 00:39:31,896
A set of Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees

519
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:33,199
and a rice shop.

520
00:39:34,639 --> 00:39:37,000
May Xiushu have both wealth and wisdom.

521
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:43,000
Well said.

522
00:39:44,039 --> 00:39:45,280
Thank you, Lanxiang.

523
00:39:47,119 --> 00:39:48,079
My gift...

524
00:39:48,599 --> 00:39:50,119
Jinqiao hasn't brought it yet.

525
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:02,320
My gift

526
00:40:02,679 --> 00:40:03,800
has quite a story behind it.

527
00:40:06,719 --> 00:40:07,960
What is it?

528
00:40:16,159 --> 00:40:17,239
Xiuwan,

529
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,599
what you've given is...

530
00:40:19,960 --> 00:40:22,000
A golden rod!

531
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:25,800
As the saying goes,

532
00:40:26,159 --> 00:40:28,599
"A thorny stick makes a filial son."

533
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:30,719
So I made Xiushu a golden rod.

534
00:40:31,719 --> 00:40:32,800
A golden rod...

535
00:40:34,000 --> 00:40:36,000
If it can make a filial son,

536
00:40:36,119 --> 00:40:37,840
it can make a good husband, too.

537
00:40:38,599 --> 00:40:39,199
Xiushu,

538
00:40:39,639 --> 00:40:41,400
if Third Master Yang ever bullies you,

539
00:40:41,400 --> 00:40:42,920
beat him with the golden rod.

540
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:45,360
But before you do,

541
00:40:45,519 --> 00:40:46,599
remember to read Lanxiang's

542
00:40:46,599 --> 00:40:48,800
Direct Explanation
of the Laws and Decrees.

543
00:40:57,760 --> 00:40:58,559
Xiuwan,

544
00:41:00,079 --> 00:41:01,519
stop embarrassing me here.

545
00:41:04,400 --> 00:41:05,519
It's thoughtful of her.

546
00:41:08,639 --> 00:41:09,519
Xiushu,

547
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:10,960
just think of it as

548
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,639
a gold bar from Xiuwan.

549
00:41:13,432 --> 00:41:14,952
That's thoughtful of you, Xiuwan.

550
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:34,719
This Hundred Children robe

551
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:36,440
was made by a palace embroiderer,

552
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:37,480
who spent nine months

553
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:39,320
stitching it by hand.

554
00:41:40,039 --> 00:41:42,199
Xiushu, may you soon be blessed

555
00:41:42,559 --> 00:41:43,519
with a baby boy.

556
00:41:43,639 --> 00:41:45,079
Thank you, Xiuru.

557
00:41:45,239 --> 00:41:47,480
May you soon have a son, too,

558
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:48,880
and see your wish fulfilled.

559
00:41:54,820 --> 00:41:57,300
(Yuan Jiarong, Lin Xiuru's stepdaughter,
First Young Lady of the Yuan family)

560
00:41:57,300 --> 00:41:59,050
(Yuan Jiawei, Second Young Lady
Yuan Jiaqin, Third Young Lady)

561
00:41:59,064 --> 00:42:00,340
(Yuan Jiaming, Fourth Young Lady)

562
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:05,159
Here comes the dowry gift!

563
00:42:23,039 --> 00:42:23,719
Xiushu,

564
00:42:24,280 --> 00:42:25,599
