565
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:29,239
What treasure is inside?

566
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:31,599
Why does this jar look

567
00:42:31,719 --> 00:42:34,039
like a cricket jar to me?

568
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:42,119
The Lin family's Third Young Madam

569
00:42:42,199 --> 00:42:44,159
gave the Fourth Young Lady a cricket.

570
00:42:44,320 --> 00:42:45,440
Once word gets out,

571
00:42:45,639 --> 00:42:48,039
it'll be quite the tale in Jinling City.

572
00:42:51,920 --> 00:42:53,280
I told you to prepare a dowry gift,

573
00:42:53,480 --> 00:42:55,239
and you got me a cricket?

574
00:42:56,239 --> 00:42:57,079
What's going on?

575
00:42:58,000 --> 00:42:59,800
This is no ordinary cricket.

576
00:42:59,800 --> 00:43:01,000
It's a Matou King.

577
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,540
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

578
00:43:09,039 --> 00:43:09,920
Xiuru.

579
00:43:10,639 --> 00:43:12,559
If you don't want Shaohui
to take a concubine,

580
00:43:13,239 --> 00:43:15,519
there's only one way now.

581
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:17,559
What way?

582
00:43:19,360 --> 00:43:20,239
If Shaohui

583
00:43:20,239 --> 00:43:22,239
insists on doing as Old Madam Yuan says

584
00:43:22,559 --> 00:43:23,840
and taking Biwu as a concubine,

585
00:43:24,760 --> 00:43:25,880
then separate from him.

586
00:43:32,360 --> 00:43:33,199
I agree.

587
00:43:34,199 --> 00:43:34,880
No.

588
00:43:36,119 --> 00:43:36,840
No.

589
00:43:53,380 --> 00:43:57,500
